::'''???:''' Welcome to the Reverie! May you experience an unforgettable holiday! If you need help checking in, please head straight to the concierge...
::'''Acheron:''' ...We're here.
::'''Acheron:''' Leave this realm, and rise as you would on any other day. Forget this fortuitous encounter, and return whence you came.
::'''Acheron:''' But before you do, I would make a request of you.
::'''Acheron:''' You may think it somewhat strange, perhaps even rude, but I wish to know...
::'''Acheron:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|...Have we met somewhere before?}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Perhaps we have.
:::'''Acheron:''' {{MC|м={{Цвет|#ff3a|You evoke memories of an old friend. In the haze of my recollections, he crossed blades with me, much like this surreal dreamscape where we stood close, yet forever out of reach.}}|ж={{Цвет|#ff3a|You evoke memories of an old friend. In the haze of my recollections, she stood shoulder to shoulder with me, much like this surreal dreamscape where we stood close, yet forever out of reach.}}}}
:::'''Acheron:''' May I ask you a few more questions? I... tend to forget things &mdash; which is why, rather than memories, I'm accustomed to using my emotions to capture what I normally wouldn't otherwise. The answer is inconsequential. Your spontaneous reaction is what matters.
:::'''Acheron:''' For instance, when you awaken in your room, your lips speak several names. Are they your companions? Family? Enemies? You seem to have forged unbreakable bonds with many people and many incidents...
:::'''Acheron:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|Might I ask if you fear losing these bonds?}}
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I cannot bear such a fear.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If it means losing them, I would.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If it means that I will disappear, I would.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I feel no fear.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't know.
:::'''Acheron:''' Mm... Then, if there was a vast dreamscape, so lifelike it's indistinguishable from reality. There, no one faces life's separations or deaths. Everyone attains their deserved happiness and lives joyfully ever after.
:::'''Acheron:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|I would ask: Would you wish to stay?}}
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I would, no matter the cost.
::::'''Acheron:''' Now... imagine if this splendid dream were fated to fall apart: Friends, family, strangers, followed by the gentle breeze, soaring birds, the stars... and ultimately, yourself.
::::'''Acheron:''' Everyone, and every face they remember, the joy and the heartaches, the vows sealed and those left hanging... all will inevitably march towards a predetermined ending. If you had grasped the journey's finale right from its inception...
::::'''Acheron:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|I would ask: Would you still embark on this journey?}}
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I would abandon it &mdash; the price is too dear.
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I would abandon it &mdash; I have already tasted the beauty of dreams.
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I would abandon it &mdash; Trailblazing was never my intent.
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I would blaze a trail without hesitation.
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't know.
::::'''Acheron:''' I know this is hard, you don't have to be hard-pressed to make a decision. As I have said... the answer is inconsequential.
::::'''Acheron:''' Hearing, touch, thought &mdash; through these, you gain emotions &mdash; cherish them. With emotions, we make choices. And so we return to the original question...
::::'''Acheron:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|I would ask... Do you still remember me?}}
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I seem to remember you from somewhere...
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No, this is the first time we've met.
::::'''Acheron:''' ...I understand.
::::'''Acheron:''' How interesting. For a split second, it felt like countless versions of you, alike yet distinct, gave entirely different responses.
::::'''Acheron:''' That was my final question, thank you. We all have our paths to walk, so we shall bid our farewells.
